# NOTE: We intentionally do NOT ignore `.env` / `.env.*` / `*.env`
# — the Emergent deploy pipeline expects `backend/.env` and
# `frontend/.env` to be present in the source tree so it can rewrite
# them with production values during MANAGE_SECRETS. If you need to
# keep a personal secret out of the repo, use `.env.local` and add a
# specific ignore rule for it.
credentials.json
*.key
.credentials
